    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ANS201 · Materials</span>\n<h2>Books & materials</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Buy or borrow the exact <strong>edition</strong> listed. Materials with no author/ISBN are internal FPT files (download them inside FLM).</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ANS201 · Tài liệu</span>\n<h2>Sách & tài liệu</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Mua/mượn đúng <strong>lần xuất bản</strong> ghi trong bảng. Tài liệu không có tác giả/ISBN là tệp nội bộ của FPT (tải trong FLM).</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Creating Character Arcs: The Masterful Author's Guide to Uniting Story Structure, Plot, and Character Development</strong></p><p>K.M. Weiland · PenForASword Publishing · 2016 · ISBN <code>ASIN: 9781944936044</code></p><p>Chọn quyển 1 trong 2 reference</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Creating Character Arcs: The Masterful Author's Guide to Uniting Story Structure, Plot, and Character Development.</strong></p><p>K.M. Weiland · PenForASword · 2016 · 1st edition · ISBN <code>978-1944936044</code></p><p>Chọn quyển 1 trong 2 reference</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>The Screenwriter's Bible, 7th Edition, A Complete Guide to Writing, Formatting, and Selling Your Script</strong> — <em>main · chính</em></p><p>David Trottier · Silman-James Press · 2019 · 7th · ISBN <code>978-1935247210</code></p></div>"
